# E4.1 §4.8: the terrain on the Earth-sized planet before and after the performance work — a range
# (the highest land, 14 million blocks east of the origin), a temperate coast, a plain and a river
# on it, from the ground and from above. Seed 7 at the game's grid (2048²); the sites are
# `bench relief --site mountains|coast|plain`'s. Kept in docs/review/e4.1/ (as JPEGs).
# `hearth --game-dir DIR --software --screenshot-list tools/shots/e41_earth.shots`
